    {
      "source": "On the server side the map can be populated initially through a\n<a href=\"../server/HandshakeInterceptor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket.server\"><code>HandshakeInterceptor</code></a>. On the client side the map can be populated via\n<a href=\"../client/WebSocketClient.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket.client\"><code>WebSocketClient</code></a> handshake methods.",
      "translation": "在服务器端，映射可以通过 <a href=\"../server/HandshakeInterceptor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket.server\"><code>HandshakeInterceptor</code></a> 进行初始填充。在客户端，映射可以通过 <a href=\"../client/WebSocketClient.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket.client\"><code>WebSocketClient</code></a> 的握手方法进行填充。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<strong>Note:</strong> The underlying standard WebSocket session (JSR-356) does\nnot allow concurrent sending. Therefore, sending must be synchronized. To ensure\nthat, one option is to wrap the <code>WebSocketSession</code> with the\n<a href=\"ConcurrentWebSocketSessionDecorator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.socket.handler\"><code>ConcurrentWebSocketSessionDecorator</code></a>.",
      "translation": "<strong>注意：</strong> 底层标准 WebSocket 会话（JSR-356）不允许并发发送。因此，必须对发送操作进行同步。为确保这一点，一种选择是将 <code>WebSocketSession</code> 包装在<a href=\"ConcurrentWebSocketSessionDecorator.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.web.socket.handler\"><code>ConcurrentWebSocketSessionDecorator</code></a>中。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "If the user has not been authenticated, the method returns <code>null</code>.",
      "translation": "如果用户尚未通过身份验证，该方法将返回<code>null</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
